  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往雷克塔尔镇与加蒙神官（83.80）对话，选“是”获得【圣女的亲笔信（伪）】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆已经持有【贝尼恰斯教团许可】无需做本任务以及无法接任务，任务无难度不需陪打",
      "type": "already-completed-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.前往库鲁克斯岛岬之神殿（832.688），通过（125.87）处进入岬之神殿。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "3.与魔法师乌莉儿（36.19）对话，选“是”,交出一定数量魔币、【圣女的亲笔信（伪）】获得【贝尼恰斯教团许可】，任务完结。",
      "type": "versioned-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆一定数量魔币：怀旧服交出100000G；时长/道具服需交出250000G",
      "type": "versioned-cost",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆怀旧服：【诺斯菲拉特通行证】可以替代魔币",
      "type": "alternate-payment",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "【诺斯菲拉特通行证】：可交易；",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "可以去交易群、2线摆摊购处买；来源临时任务《新魔法大学挑战赛》",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◇做到此步即可从雷村坐船到柯村练级；",
      "type": "access-effect",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "《重拾勇气的掘地族》任务，目的为开通哥拉尔-雷克塔尔村传送，与其他人组队练级需做",
      "type": "related-quest",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "柯马特依村（柯村）去法：",
      "type": "route-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "1.拥有“解放者”称号，持有【贝尼恰斯教团许可】返回雷克塔尔村，",
      "type": "access-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "2.前往港湾管理处（100.78）交出船费坐船前往柯马特依村。",
      "type": "boat-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆怀旧服船费为1000G；时长/道具服船费为2000G",
      "type": "versioned-cost",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "支线任务：",
      "type": "branch-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "1.雷克塔尔村，前往港湾管理处（100.78）交出船费坐船前往柯马特依村。",
      "type": "boat-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "2.抵达柯马特依村，出村西门（37.71）向西走抵达诺斯菲拉特（750.100）附近，击倒烟雾和堀地虫随机获得【毒气样本】。",
      "type": "battle-drop",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "◆柯马特依村（柯村）：无资深护士/护士；",
      "type": "service-warning",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "柯马特依村（柯村）村外，诺斯菲拉特魔物：",
      "type": "encounter-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "门口：死亡树精（80~82级会超风）；影岩（80~82级会自爆）3~8个/场",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "#练级地点#离村远一些的怪：堀地虫（80~82级会石化攻击） 烟雾（80~82级会超毒）8~10个/场",
      "type": "training-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "3.持有【毒气样本】，与诺斯菲拉特（73.66）卡恩神官对话，交出【毒气样本】获得【未完成的护身符】，任务完结。",
      "type": "branch-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "◆【未完成的护身符】只能拥有一个。扔掉之后可无限次兑换",
      "type": "repeat-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "【未完成的护身符】：",
      "type": "reward-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "⑴（怀旧服）：Lv.8护身符、耐久150；攻击+20、防御+10、抗毒+5、闪躲+8、抗魔+25；",
      "type": "versioned-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "数值浮动、不可交易、丢地消失",
      "type": "item-restriction",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "⑵（时道服）：Lv.8护身符、耐久150；攻击+50、防御+25、抗毒+50、闪躲+18、抗魔+120；",
      "type": "versioned-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "数值浮动、不可交易、丢地消失",
      "type": "item-restriction",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
